PCC2’s TxCTL and TxICR blocks qualify: the selector indexes the register being updated, and TxICR also re-tests it. The shipped probe has rows for both timer labels. Footbridge’s timer-clear fix has one case label after address folding, so its multiple input addresses do not meet Q1’s stacked-label criterion.
