1222: 
1223: # --------------------------------------------- de-escalation ACCEPT rows (byte writes)
1224: #  Removing twelve exit(1)s destroys the tripwire that announced guard growth.  So the
1225: #  legal width must still LAND at each reachable arm, through its own mask, with no
1226: #  decline message.  Expected values from the arms' own semantics.
