1333:         "%s unchanged after a declined put h at the T1 label -- a fall-through lands 0xb8 & mask (RMW at TxCTL: 0)" % nm.upper())
1334: 
1335: # --------------------------------- IPL (guest-reachable, EVEN) and MASK (operator, odd)
1336: #  IPL 0x3e: a halfword at 0x3e lands in the IPL arm.  Its write side is read-only (#119
1337: #  "ignored"), so a wide write is declined by the WIDTH latch first and a readback cannot
1338: #  tell the two refusals apart -- the channel is the message.
