270: #  *** THE PAINT MUST BE PINNED AT THE ORACLE ADDRESS, IN ITS OWN SESSION. ***
271: #  `live' proves RAM works at SCRATCH, which is NOT where the fill lands.  Without this row an
272: #  inequality against the paint passes on zeros, on the leftover sentinel, on a missed print and
273: #  on a dead session.  A SEPARATE session because `printed()' returns the FIRST match: two reads
274: #  of v0 in one session return the same sample.
275: A = Addr(CODE)
276: t, alive = session(store(A, DEST, PAINT) + load(A, DEST) + ["print v0"])
